  "schema:name": "Aboveground biomass",
  "schema:description": "Counterfactual management-treatment scenario applied to the 2024 western-CONUS baseline: a modeled what-if outcome, not an observed state. Aboveground live biomass (mainly tree); total mass, not carbon. Hybrid biomass product integrating field-plot observations and remote sensing. Units: metric tons / hectare.",
